#. Add-on summary/title, usually the user visible name of the add-on
#. Translators: Summary/title for this add-on
#. to be shown on installation and add-on information found in add-on store
#: buildVars.py:23
msgid "List networks and recover password."
msgstr "Liste redes e recupere a senha."

#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
#: buildVars.py:26
msgid ""
"This addon lists the networks that have been saved on this system and tries "
"when possible to recover the password."
msgstr ""
"Este addon lista as redes que foram salvas neste sistema e tenta quando "
"possível recuperar a senha."

